  "notes": "Area order_hint follows the DS2 world-map reference already established for Laura's playthrough: Things Betwixt -> Forest of Fallen Giants -> Cardinal Tower -> Heide's Tower of Flame -> No Man's Wharf -> Lost Bastille -> Sinner's Rise as main path, with Forest of Fallen Giants -> Shaded Woods -> Shaded Ruins -> Doors of Pharros as a branch. Remaining areas (Huntsman's Copse, Harvest Valley/Earthen Peak/Iron Keep, Brightstone Cove, Drangleic Castle, Undead Crypt, Dragon Aerie/Shrine, DLC zones) are placed by community-standard progress order since Laura's playthrough hasn't reached them yet \u2014 order_hint values will likely need adjusting once she actually gets there, since DS2 branches heavily. aliases intentionally empty for you to fill in."
}